{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clockwork Palace</strong> is a cozy Mughal fantasy puzzle adventure designed as a learning supplement, where time has stopped\u2014and only you can set it right. Explore hand-painted halls, mirror chambers, and celestial observatories while solving 40+ clever time-based puzzles. Team up with a playful jinn companion, gather Time Gems, and restore the palace\u2019s lost magic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mughal-inspired fantasy world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/afea402198686d447351553694134aa8.poster.avif?t=1771243196\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/afea402198686d447351553694134aa8.webm?t=1771243196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/afea402198686d447351553694134aa8.mp4?t=1771243196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplement learning with focused repetition of time puzzles to help build fluency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/faa8176682bbbdd5c17efce8029b1605.poster.avif?t=1771243196\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/faa8176682bbbdd5c17efce8029b1605.webm?t=1771243196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463220/extras/faa8176682bbbdd5c17efce8029b1605.mp4?t=1771243196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class